15:["$","p",null,{"children":"Somewhere in that climb the old name stopped fitting. We weren't a web studio anymore — we were the team a company calls when something core has to change. So we became WeEvolveIT, and built around the one constant we'd learned: never stand still. That's the real shift: we don't sell technology like a commodity. We plug in as a part of your company — the team whose job is to know every process and need of your business, and keep you current as the ground keeps moving."}]
